[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_00_0010","text":"……！\n小奈……你那边……有敌人……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_00_0020","text":"诶？　哪里哪里！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_00_0030","text":"从我这边的话\n攻击不到……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_00_0040","text":"我现在能做的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_00_0005","text":"总之先移动！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_00_0006","text":"火力全开！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_00_0007","text":"用必杀技吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_01_0010","text":"啊……\n往制作人那边去了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_01_0020","text":"制作人！\n快逃～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_02_0010","text":"啊，制作人的子弹\n打中了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_02_0020","text":"谢谢！\n得救了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_03_0010","text":"啊……咦……？\n舞台全部爆炸了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_03_0020","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04030000_03_0030","text":"Motion"}]
